cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this exact source revision when using the verification packet."
title: "Family 059: exact verification by weighted GCD cancellation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Towell
    given-names: Alexander Richard
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6443-9897"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-23
abstract: >-
  Independent exact arithmetic verification of OpenAI's supplied 849-coefficient
  finite product relation, using compressed weighted GCD splitting. Includes
  source pins, a written soundness argument, tests and rejection controls.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; source construction credited to OpenAI
  and predecessor exact verification to Pico / Håkon Åmdal. The topological
  theorem and kernel verification are outside scope.
